          "text": "**Slide 3: Overview**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "goal: design a digital space that reflects professor keaton’s intellectual clarity, interdisciplinary focus, and public engagement"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "visual ethos: minimalist, muted, nuanced"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "tonal priority: subtle over loud, presence over performance"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
